@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+---
+id: task-002-record-createdat-and-updatedat-on-each-task
+type: task
+title: "Record createdAt and updatedAt on each task"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Every task now has `createdAt` and `updatedAt` (ISO-8601 date-time strings). They are equal when the
+task is added; completing, reopening, renaming, tagging and untagging set `updatedAt` to the time of the
+change. A refused change leaves the task untouched. Tests added in `test/list.test.ts`.
